Modifications made by Query Farm LLC relative to the upstream project:

  - Go module paths renamed from github.com/duckdb/duckdb-go-bindings to
    github.com/Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn-go-bindings (root module and the five
    per-platform lib/<platform> submodules).
  - The pre-built static-library archives are fetched from the Haybarn engine's
    GitHub Releases (Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn) instead of DuckDB's. These carry
    libhaybarn_static.a — the Haybarn engine build, which embeds the single
    Haybarn extension trust root and the haybarn-extensions.query.farm core and
    community extension repository URLs. DuckDB-signed extensions do not load.
  - The cgo linker flag -lduckdb_static is correspondingly -lhaybarn_static; all
    other archive names (extensions, third-party libraries, the C API header
    duckdb.h, and the duckdb_ C symbol surface) are preserved unchanged for ABI
    compatibility with upstream DuckDB.
  - Makefile fetch target, documentation, and CI repointed at the Haybarn org.
